<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Sanger USD, Calif., for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Sanger USD, Calif., for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it qualified for municipal bond insurance Sanger Unified School District, Calif., $1.765 million certificate of participation scheduled for competitive sale today. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
